{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 22, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Arthur awoke to the chirping of birds, a sound oddly…crisp. He sat up in bed, the sunlight streaming through the window feeling too bright, too perfect. His bedroom was meticulously organized, almost unnaturally so, with furniture arranged in a way that felt staged. A notification popped up in his vision, a translucent overlay on reality: \"Quest Available: Gather 5 Forest Berries.\" He blinked, and the notification vanished. He looked at his hands - they were…normal. Too normal. He tried to reach for his glasses, but his hand passed right through the bedside table. Panic began to bubble in his chest. He glanced out the window and saw other people walking by, their heads tilted at slightly unnatural angles, their movements jerky and repetitive. Everything felt…scripted.\n\n***\n\nHe cautiously stepped outside, the world resolving into vibrant, almost cartoonish detail. The trees were impossibly green, the sky a flawless blue. A small, pixelated creature with oversized ears scurried past, muttering something about needing to level up. Arthur felt a wave of nausea wash over him. He was in a video game. A poorly optimized, low-poly video game. He tried to scream, but no sound came out. Another notification appeared: \"Tutorial Complete: Basic Movement & Interaction.\" Below it, a set of instructions: \"Press W to move forward, A to move left, etc.\" He groaned. This was going to be a long day. He had berries to gather.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "Arthur", "logprob": -0.16696929931640625}, {"token": "▁awoke", "logprob": -1.2383593320846558}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.054918527603149414}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.003814208786934614}, {"token": "▁chir", "logprob": -0.19551058113574982}, {"token": "ping", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -5.722029527532868e-06}, {"token": "▁birds", "logprob": -0.3132776916027069}, {"token": ",", "logprob"